  "articles": [
    {
      "id": "r20261113-a01",
      "title": "A New Friend at the Park",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "Bimo was new in town. On Sunday afternoon, he sat alone on a bench in the park. He had some bread in his bag, so he fed the ducks in the small pond.",
        "A boy about his age watched him from the swings. \"Can I help?\" he asked. Bimo gave him half of the bread. Soon they were both laughing as the ducks fought over every piece.",
        "The boy’s name was Gilang. He knew all the best places in the park: the tall slide, the shady tree, the pond where the big fish hid. When Bimo’s mother called him, the two boys made a plan to meet again next Sunday. New places feel warmer with a new friend."
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "bench": "bangku",
        "fed": "memberi makan",
        "pond": "kolam",
        "swings": "ayunan",
        "fought over": "memperebutkan",
        "shady": "rindang",
        "hid": "bersembunyi"
      },
