    {
      "id": "r20261113-a02",
      "title": "The Rise of Plant-Based Meat",
      "level": "Menengah",
      "min": 3,
      "body": [
        "A burger that \"bleeds\" but has no meat? Welcome to the world of plant-based meat. Made from soy, peas, or mushrooms, these products look, cook, and taste like real meat.",
        "The market is exploding for two reasons. First, many people want to eat less meat for their health. Second, producing beef creates far more greenhouse gases than producing plants. A plant-based burger can cut that footprint by ninety percent.",
        "Not everyone is convinced. Some say the products are too processed and too expensive. But prices are falling every year, and the taste keeps improving. \"Five years ago, my customers laughed at the idea,\" says one restaurant owner. \"Now the plant burger is our best seller.\""
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "plant-based": "berbahan dasar tumbuhan",
        "soy": "kedelai",
        "peas": "kacang polong",
        "footprint": "jejak (karbon)",
        "processed": "olahan",
        "convinced": "yakin",
